WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.628 --> 00:00:11.954
Open any lesson and press Teach. It goes full screen, ready for the projector.

2
00:00:11.954 --> 00:00:18.268
First, attendance. Tap the pupils who are absent.

3
00:00:18.268 --> 00:00:29.628
Start the lesson. The clock counts down each stage and the pacing coach warns you if you run over.

4
00:00:29.628 --> 00:00:42.033
The toolkit is always at hand. The name picker only picks pupils who are here.

5
00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:55.683
Groups can be mixed ability or by level, and keep apart the pupils you choose.

6
00:00:55.683 --> 00:01:07.133
There is also a noise light, team points, an attention signal and a timer.

7
00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:14.407
Press Next to move to the next stage.

8
00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:21.675
If the phone locks or the page reloads, Teach mode carries on from the same stage.

9
00:01:21.675 --> 00:01:28.595
At the end, compare planned and actual time, then record PBD or write your reflection.

10
00:01:28.595 --> 00:01:30.997
Next: watch "Classes and PBD".
